      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name}:  The documentation explicitly states \"the viseme sil corresponds to a silent/neutral expression\". There's no distinguishing between \"mic off/inactive\" or \"silence\" in the Oculus docs.\n\nThis report is not so much a bug as it is diverging from the Oculus module conventions. Should I put it in Feature requests then?",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
